to-be-incorporated-into-paper-139 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Running processes.** `lib/world.cub` is the drivers' signature `W` (`time-now`, `write fd n b`," (cons "`read fd n`, `sleep ns`, `exit c` as processes of `lib/proc.cub`) and `to-step p` a process as a" (cons "tree of steps; `#run (to-step p)` performs it against the operating system (`src/drivers.c`)," (cons "ending with `run: done a`. The machine as a library: `build/libcubical.a` with `src/libcubical.h`," (cons "a C program loads libraries with `cubical_init` and calls checked definitions on words with" (cons "`cubical_call_w`. `%gsteps n` is the steps checked definition `n` took to check, from the run or" (cons "the store's `ok` line." nil)))))))
